# 行尾规范：Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会乱（中文提示变乱码、命令被截断）
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# 其他文本文件统一 LF
*.go   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.mod  text eol=lf
*.sum  text eol=lf

# 二进制：不参与换行转换、不参与 diff
*.exe binary
*.db  binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
